            "sid": "2CO 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aseasa iisisinyi gadiyeeda sea niny, hean geemuscheegwa gideaba adiidu ghoanyaschi dagheerjeanduumeeda ASEETA mwadaagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwayi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghuusigaasa sijaachi aba heedeang'wa, ea fuga Gorinto; nea gurooruunatkaasa ea nibareahiidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aseasa meakghumeegwa, agooga ghoaghuumeegwa haleanjeedida oabwariinyiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba yamiteaba geaw geabalooldi gili eabalooli diibiga, oapwargiida gurooruunatkeagwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Reekusiinda seareeda fuga mandeawana masaweega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu ghoang'waanyi geat sea fuga mandeawana masaweega. Aba naweeda mwadoabiiwa, aba gideaba gwanda duupcheemba naaha mida dageascheeda doobiiwnata ea heeheeweega? Nuut gicha gwanda rooroocheemba naaha mida dageascheeda weeshinda ea misaneeda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwanda giiyang'deayeemba naaha dageascheeda Gristo sea Gidamuy? Ghana siida mideawa masaweega neada gaygwandeayeesa naaha sea siida mandeawana masaweega? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neada gwanda neajeemba naaha dageascheeda gheeda sibata ASEETA sea sanaamu? Aba gideaba aseasa geewooschi gheeda sibata ASEETA majeek; ak gawuurji ginyaashta ASEETA nea gwayi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
